    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [X] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [X] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n- [X] I have updated 'mini.nvim' to latest version\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.files\n\n### Description\n\nWhen a file is a symlink, mini.files doesn't open it\n\n### Neovim version\n\nNightly v0.11.0-dev+599-g8df6736ca\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create a symlink\r\n2. Try to open it with mini.files\n\n### Expected behavior\n\nThe target file of the symlink opens\n\n### Actual behavior\n\nNothing happens",
