            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "@echasnovski Yes, I created the symlinks using a relative file path. Could that perhaps be an upstream bug if the `:edit` command doesn't work with it either?\r\n\r\nAlso, in case it matters, I got this issue while managing files on a mounted ssh server (I guess it uses sshfs but I'm not sure how Gnome does stuff). Though I don't think this is relevant to the issue since you're able to reproduce in on a local filesystem.",
