        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> Could that perhaps be an upstream bug if the `:edit` command doesn't work with it either?\r\n\r\nIt is certainly possible, however it is not only `:edit` that behaves this way but also `vim.uv.fs_stat()` doesn't recognize these \"relative symlinks\" as paths that actually exist on disk. As both of these come from different parts of software with long history of widespread use and tests, I'd say this is intentional.\r\n\r\nOn latest `main` this case at least results into a notification which shows information about *why* there is nothing happening. I think this is the best 'mini.files' can do here.",
